        "text": "<thinking> To handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens, I will use the Google OAuth2 provider as the concrete external provider. I will create the file `oauth_callback.py` in the current working directory and include the necessary code to handle the OAuth2 flow with Google. </thinking>\n",
