      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `start_oauth_login.py` that starts an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login using a concrete external provider, I will choose Google as the provider. Google's OAuth 2.0 system is well-documented and widely used. I will use the `google-auth` library to handle the OAuth flow. </thinking>\n",
